        <review>&lt;p&gt;Once you read Don Norman, you never look at a door handle, light switch, or form interface the same way again. His vocabulary of &lt;strong&gt;affordances&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;signifiers&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;mapping&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;feedback&lt;/strong&gt; translates directly into building clearer digital products.&lt;/p&gt;</review>
